y":"Bumps [hono](https://github.com/honojs/hono) from 4.13.13 to 4.13.14.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/honojs/hono/releases\">hono's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v4.13.14</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>docs(contributing): ask for issues instead of RPs <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5526\">honojs/hono#5526</a></li>\n<li>docs(readme): sync the contributing list with CONTRIBUTING.md <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5527\">honojs/hono#5527</a></li>\n<li>fix(adapters): accept Hono v5 prereleases in the <code>hono</code> peer range <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5537\">honojs/hono#5537</a></li>\n<li>chore: unified oxfmt and oxlint config <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5518\">honojs/hono#5518</a></li>\n<li>docs(readme): remove the deepwiki badge <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5548\">honojs/hono#5548</a></li>\n<li>fix(serve-static): only serve GET and HEAD requests <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5514\">honojs/hono#5514</a></li>\n<li>fix(build): keep barrel imports in the bundled <code>d.ts</code> <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5557\">honojs/hono#5557</a></li>\n<li>fix(jsx): preserve self-closing void elements in cloneElement <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5314\">honojs/hono#5314</a></li>\n<li>fix(css): keep &quot;//&quot; inside an unquoted url() when minifying <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5450\">honojs/hono#5450</a></li>\n<li>fix(css): keep the descendant combinator before a pseudo-class when minifying <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5451\">honojs/hono#5451</a></li>\n<li>fix(serve-static): respect q-values in Accept-Encoding for precompressed files <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5436\">honojs/hono#5436</a></li>\n<li>fix(helper/route): match regex params in basePath() the same way as the router <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5498\">honojs/hono#5498</a></li>\n<li>fix(trie-router): keep first value for duplicate path params <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5423\">honojs/hono#5423</a></li>\n<li>fix(hono-base): disallow <code>getPath</code> when <code>strict</code> is <code>false</code> <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5563\">honojs/hono#5563</a></li>\n<li>fix(css): Fix multiline CSS handling in style replacement <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5405\">honojs/hono#5405</a></li>\n<li>feat(bearer-auth): allow MessageFunction to return a Response <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5269\">honojs/hono#5269</a></li>\n<li>fix(utils/url): preserve encoded duplicate query order <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5495\">honojs/hono#5495</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/honojs/hono/compare/v4.13.13...v4.13.14\">https://github.com/honojs/hono/compare/v4.13.13...v4.13.14</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/honojs/hono/commit/bac5c4a8bcd76b165428ce757e1185753c7935bd\"><code>bac5c4a</code></a> 4.13.14</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/honojs/hono/commit/eb78ecaabe26baa8addc053cf8a94b5b7603c001\"><code>eb78eca</code></a> fix(utils/url): preserve encoded duplicate query order (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/issues/5495\">#5495</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/honojs/hono/commit/06a45bc3a639c1f9eea28e16370bc03447f0d7cb\"><code>06a45bc</code></a> feat(bearer-auth): allow MessageFunction to return a Response (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/honojs/hono/issues/5269\">#5269</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/honojs/hono/commit/5ca49b0720755c585c9a9835f0a479ceea36fb52\"><code>5ca49b0</code></a> fix(css): Fix multil